OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order challenge against NI
OL,4,Asecretary and chief constable begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe High Court in Belfast has begun
OL,7,Fhearing a legal challenge against the
OL,8,Fsecretary of state's decision to ban
OL,9,Fthe Drumcree parade on security advice.
OL,11,FThe case is being brought by a
OL,12,FPortadown Orangeman against Sir Chris
OL,13,FBryant and Chief Constable Jon
OL,14,FBoutcher.
OL,16,FSir Chris' intervention ended a
OL,17,Ftwo-week stand-off after the parade
OL,18,Froute on Garvaghy Road was blocked by
OL,19,Fprotesters.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
